{"text": "Nov-13-2001 TUE\n\n248 PH Fax NO, 8015321486 P.\n\nRaising Resilient\nChildren Foundation\n\nSam Goldstein, Ph.D,\nRobert Brooks, Ph.D.\nCo-Executive Directors\n\nFAX - (917) 663-0449\n(Original Mailed)\n\nNovember 13, 2001\n\nLinda Hadel Hopkins\nPhilip Morris, USA\n120 Park Avenue, 4\" floor\nNew York, New York 10017\n\nRe: Detailed Budgets\nDear Linda:\n\nThope this finds you well, We very much appreciate your interest on behalf of Philip Morris\nIn providing support for our Resilience Project. After some discussion, we have decided\nthat the order of importance we are interested in developing is first, the radio syndication,\nthen creating the public service announcement spots, then distributing copies of the\nRaising Resilient Children book and parenting program and finally, underwriting the first\nnational conference,\n\nIncluded with this correspondence are detailed budgets for the radio syndication and public\nservice announcements.\n\nYou will note that the total budget to create the 140 radio syndication spots comes to\n$46,700.00. The plan is to use the additional $200,000.00 requested to underwrite and\nset In motion the syndication on a national basis, such that it will eventually be a sought.\nafter product and stand on its own with additional underwriting and/or sponsors attracted\nto it.\n\n230 South 500 East, Suite 100\nSalt Lake City, UT Sul02\n\n(80) 532-1u8u\nVisit our website at www raisingresilientkids com\n\n02\n\n\u00a3260295802", "words": [{"text": "Nov-13-2001", "x0": 59, "y0": 67, "x1": 130, "y1": 79, "conf": 76.0}, {"text": "TUE", "x0": 139, "y0": 69, "x1": 158, "y1": 79, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "248", "x0": 181, "y0": 69, "x1": 199, "y1": 80, "conf": 57.0}, {"text": "PH", "x0": 206, "y0": 69, "x1": 219, "y1": 80, "conf": 77.0}, {"text": "Fax", "x0": 411, "y0": 72, "x1": 429, "y1": 83, "conf": 78.0}, {"text": "NO,", "x0": 437, "y0": 72, "x1": 450, "y1": 83, "conf": 87.0}, {"text": "8015321486", "x0": 464, "y0": 73, "x1": 528, "y